{"list_html":"  <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured\" data-anim=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-media\" data-media-type=\"image\">\n              <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__image\"\n          src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Temoignage_Merz_Aesthetics_1_200kb.jpg\"\n          alt=\"Merz Aesthetics fit-out project by Ronnsquare\"\n          loading=\"lazy\">\n          <\/div>\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-content\">\n              <blockquote class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-quote\">&ldquo;We were particularly impressed by the excellent collaboration between the project manager and the talented architect, who delivered a project that perfectly matched both our constraints and our aspirations&rdquo;<\/blockquote>\n            <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author\">\n                  <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-avatar\" src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Nicolas_de_La_Hosseraye_Merz_Aesthetics_200kb.png\" alt=\"Nicolas de La Hosseraye\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author-info\">\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-name\">Nicolas de La Hosseraye<\/span>\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-role\">Chief Executive Officer \u2013 Merz Aesthetics<\/span>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured\" data-anim=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-media\" data-media-type=\"image\">\n              <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__image\"\n          src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Temoignage_Horus_Pharma_2_200KB.jpg\"\n          alt=\"Horus Pharma offices fitted out by Ronnsquare\"\n          loading=\"lazy\">\n          <\/div>\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-content\">\n              <blockquote class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-quote\">&ldquo;We didn\u2019t really know which direction to take at the start. Ronnsquare helped us refocus, presented several options to refine our decision, and guided us through numerous discussions, reviews, and iterations throughout the process&rdquo;<\/blockquote>\n            <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author\">\n                  <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-avatar\" src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Megane_Jeanson_Horus_Pharma_200kb.png\" alt=\"Megane Jeanson\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author-info\">\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-name\">Megane Jeanson<\/span>\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-role\">Head of Facilities Management \u2013 Horus Pharma<\/span>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured\" data-anim=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-media\" data-media-type=\"image\">\n              <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__image\"\n          src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Temoignage_Groupe_Pharma_3_200kb.jpg\"\n          alt=\"A pharmaceutical group&#039;s fit-out project by Ronnsquare\"\n          loading=\"lazy\">\n          <\/div>\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-content\">\n              <blockquote class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-quote\">&ldquo;We had outgrown our offices in the building and were given the opportunity to move to another floor. We needed a partner to support us and ensure the transition was carried out under the best possible conditions&rdquo;<\/blockquote>\n            <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author\">\n                  <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-avatar\" src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Office_manager_Groupe_Pharmaceutique_200kb.png\" alt=\"Confidential\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author-info\">\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-name\">Confidential<\/span>\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-role\">Office Manager \u2013 Pharmaceutical Group<\/span>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured\" data-anim=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-media\" data-media-type=\"image\">\n              <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__image\"\n          src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Temoignage_IM_Projet_200kb.jpg\"\n          alt=\"IM Projet fit-out project by Ronnsquare\"\n          loading=\"lazy\">\n          <\/div>\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-content\">\n              <blockquote class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-quote\">&ldquo;Even while we were still in the study phase and had not yet signed a contract, Ronnsquare pushed the design work quite far. As a result, when we made our decision, we had a very clear understanding of where the project was heading&rdquo;<\/blockquote>\n            <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author\">\n                  <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-avatar\" src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Philippe_Regis_IM_Projet_200kb.png\" alt=\"Philippe R\u00e9gis\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author-info\">\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-name\">Philippe R\u00e9gis<\/span>\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-role\">President \u2013 IM Projet<\/span>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured\" data-anim=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-media\" data-media-type=\"image\">\n              <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__image\"\n          src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Temoignage_Niterra_200kb.jpg\"\n          alt=\"Niterra fit-out project by Ronnsquare\"\n          loading=\"lazy\">\n          <\/div>\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-content\">\n              <blockquote class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-quote\">&ldquo;We truly have an office that everyone\u2014both our employees and visiting colleagues\u2014enjoys. Everyone has congratulated us on this success and the quality of the fit-out&rdquo;<\/blockquote>\n            <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author\">\n                  <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-avatar\" src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Maxime_Vigouroux_Niterra_200kb.png\" alt=\"Maxime Vigouroux\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author-info\">\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-name\">Maxime Vigouroux<\/span>\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-role\">Chief Manager \u2013 Niterra<\/span>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured\" data-anim=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-media\" data-media-type=\"image\">\n              <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__image\"\n          src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Temoignage_IM_Projet_200kb.jpg\"\n          alt=\"IM Projet fit-out project by Ronnsquare\"\n          loading=\"lazy\">\n          <\/div>\n    <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-content\">\n              <blockquote class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-quote\">&ldquo;Ronnsquare understood our needs very quickly and took all of our requests and requirements fully into account&rdquo;<\/blockquote>\n            <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author\">\n                  <img class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-avatar\" src=\"\/assets\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Philippe_Regis_IM_Projet_200kb.jpg\" alt=\"Philippe R\u00e9gis\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                <div class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-author-info\">\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-name\">Philippe R\u00e9gis<\/span>\n          <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__featured-role\">President \u2013 IM Projet<\/span>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n","pagination_html":"    <nav class=\"block-11-1-reviews__pagination\" aria-label=\"Testimonials pagination\">\n              <button type=\"button\" class=\"block-11-1-reviews__page block-11-1-reviews__page--prev\" data-page=\"6\">\n          <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&larr;<\/span> Previous        <\/button>\n      \n                        <button type=\"button\" class=\"block-11-1-reviews__page\" data-page=\"1\">1<\/button>\n                                <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__page block-11-1-reviews__ellipsis\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2026<\/span>\n                                <button type=\"button\" class=\"block-11-1-reviews__page\" data-page=\"6\">6<\/button>\n                                <span class=\"block-11-1-reviews__page is-current\" aria-current=\"page\">7<\/span>\n                                <button type=\"button\" class=\"block-11-1-reviews__page\" data-page=\"8\">8<\/button>\n                                <button type=\"button\" class=\"block-11-1-reviews__page\" data-page=\"9\">9<\/button>\n              \n              <button type=\"button\" class=\"block-11-1-reviews__page block-11-1-reviews__page--next\" data-page=\"8\">\n          Next <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;<\/span>\n        <\/button>\n          <\/nav>\n    ","paged":7,"total_pages":9,"total":53}